OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and largely sunny day
OL,6,Ftoday with just a little high cloud
OL,7,Fdeveloping during the afternoon.
OL,8,FFeeling hot if not very hot for some
OL,9,Fwith light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry and very warm evening
OL,12,Fwith plenty of late sunshine.
OL,13,FOvernight will remain warm, leading to
OL,14,Fan uncomfortable night to sleep.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FA warm and sunny start, but
OL,17,Fcloud tending to increase throughout
OL,18,Fthe day making the sunshine hazy. A
OL,19,Ffew showers also possibly developing
OL,20,Fcome the afternoon. Feeling a little
OL,21,Fcooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
