OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,6,Fdry throughout the weekend with a mix
OL,7,Fof cloud and sunshine. Dry initially
OL,8,FMonday but rain may move in later.
OL,9,FFeeling cooler as temperatures return
OL,10,Fto nearer average.
